    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n\nA beautifully refurbished three-bedroom terraced house. \n\nRecently refurbished throughout to a high standard, this lovely property offers modern, comfortable living with the convenience of a turnkey move-in experience. The accommodation features a brand-new kitchen with a full range of new appliances, newly fitted bathrooms, gas central heating, and three generous bedrooms, each offering excellent storage.\n\n Bright, fresh and thoughtfully presented, the house combines practical living with a stylish, contemporary finish. Unfurnished, it provides tenants with the flexibility to make the space their own from day one.\n\n Situated in a highly convenient location close to the airport, with excellent access to local amenities and transport links. \n\nA fantastic opportunity to rent a beautifully refurbished home where everything is fresh, modern and ready to go. \n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
